  "name": "bindsight: a reproducible bridge from RNA-seq to de novo protein binder design",
  "description": "bindsight is an open-source Python package that produces ranked de novo protein binder candidates directly from bulk or single-cell RNA-seq counts, using an opinionated pipeline that joins differential expression analysis, the human surfaceome (SURFY + SURFACE-Bind), AlphaFoldDB structures, deep-learning binder design (RFdiffusion + ProteinMPNN, BindCraft, or BoltzGen), and affinity validation (Boltz-2, Chai-1r, or AF2-IG), with end-to-end PROV-O / RO-Crate provenance.",
